Package: zplexpress
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18.0.0), cups, cups-client, xdg-utils, ocom-ocbp-t4201-driver (>= 1.0.3)
Maintainer: Louis Nyirongo <louisnyirongo@lukeinternational.no>
Homepage: https://github.com/malawi-ministry-of-health-dhd/zplexpress
Description: Local ZPL-to-PDF printing service with OCOM USB detection
 A Node.js service that receives ZPL (Zebra Programming Language) over HTTP
 and prints to a CUPS printer. OCOM OCBP-T4201 jobs can be rendered locally
 to exact-size PDF or routed through the installed ZPL-to-TSPL translator,
 with physical USB connection detection and a web configuration dashboard.
